---
description: Decide field-level findings for selectSceneVariants.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Select or generate approved-style variants that fit audience choices and current resources. Preserve the dramatic beat, character knowledge, and consent boundaries; avoid replacing a missing prop with an unsafe physical action or unsupported audience involvement. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
